      "type": "text",
      "id": "banner_t",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 678.675,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "Same event-sourcing shape the pipeline already leans on:  GCS is the LOG  ·  the DB is the VIEW.\nPostgres is a projection — droppable and re-derivable from GCS, so a DB outage degrades recall to\ntoday's graph-JSON fallback and never breaks the pipeline.   Feature-flagged · backfillable · reversible.",
      "originalText": "Same event-sourcing shape the pipeline already leans on:  GCS is the LOG  ·  the DB is the VIEW.\nPostgres is a projection — droppable and re-derivable from GCS, so a DB outage degrades recall to\ntoday's graph-JSON fallback and never breaks the pipeline.   Feature-flagged · backfillable · reversible.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
